We are.

25:09.880 --> 25:12.120
But K isn't tired yet, is he?

25:25.280 --> 25:26.840
SOCIAL ETIQUETTE STATION

25:26.920 --> 25:30.000
You don't have to be scared
of ghosts here.

25:30.080 --> 25:32.360
It's the seniors you should be scared of.

25:32.440 --> 25:36.200
If any of the seniors here
order you to do something…

25:36.280 --> 25:39.840
…don't ask why.

25:39.920 --> 25:41.360
Let's begin.

25:42.560 --> 25:45.800
WELCOME FRESHMEN

25:46.840 --> 25:48.480
Do it properly.

25:50.440 --> 25:51.640
Bless you, kids.

26:02.160 --> 26:03.200
K…

26:04.000 --> 26:06.240
I have a special senior
arranged for you tonight.

26:09.240 --> 26:11.640
Here comes the big boss.

26:12.880 --> 26:15.120
-Good evening.
-Hello, sir.

26:22.800 --> 26:23.760
That's a dog.

26:26.040 --> 26:31.040
He may be a dog,
but Mr. Lucky has seniority over you.

26:31.760 --> 26:33.800
He's been here longer than even me.

26:35.400 --> 26:38.760
Do you want the seniority system
that we all revere

26:38.840 --> 26:41.040
to get undermined just because of you?

26:44.320 --> 26:45.160
I won't.

26:46.160 --> 26:47.440
I told you to bow.

26:49.120 --> 26:52.120
Bow down on the ground right now.
What's so hard about that?

26:53.040 --> 26:54.800
Don't keep Mr. Lucky waiting.

27:01.600 --> 27:03.400
Do it like you mean it!

27:05.520 --> 27:06.600
Is it that hard?

27:07.640 --> 27:10.280
You punk.
Why are you being so disrespectful?

27:11.680 --> 27:14.680
Are you a pussy?
All right, get up!

27:14.760 --> 27:16.120
Bow to your senior.

27:25.200 --> 27:27.680
Press your palms together nicely

27:28.400 --> 27:30.960
and bow down to the ground.

27:36.160 --> 27:38.800
Bend your head lower, K.

27:39.520 --> 27:42.480
That wasn't so hard, was it?

27:43.720 --> 27:45.440
Mr. Lucky is happy now.

28:17.520 --> 28:18.920
Damn it, K.

28:19.520 --> 28:21.440
Can't you just do as the seniors say?

28:21.520 --> 28:24.400
Don't you know
that we're all getting in trouble

28:25.080 --> 28:26.640
because of your bad behavior?

28:27.480 --> 28:29.240
If you behave yourself tomorrow,

28:30.320 --> 28:31.680
I'll let you sleep with us.

28:45.320 --> 28:47.480
What?

28:49.480 --> 28:50.920
What the fuck do you want?

29:05.960 --> 29:07.040
There, there.

29:07.760 --> 29:09.920
It's okay, Mr. Lucky.

29:10.720 --> 29:15.760
K just misses being a senior
who can beat up anyone he wants.

29:26.120 --> 29:27.680
What do you want from me, Nanno?

29:29.840 --> 29:31.480
What does Nanno want?

29:39.120 --> 29:41.920
What I really want is…

29:43.720 --> 29:46.280
I really want you to…

29:53.440 --> 29:54.280
Oops.

29:59.960 --> 30:01.040
Hey, everyone!

30:02.040 --> 30:03.960
K hurt Mr. Lucky!

30:04.600 --> 30:06.680
Mr. Lucky has run off!

30:13.440 --> 30:14.280
You're fucked.

30:16.320 --> 30:17.360
Lucky.

30:18.120 --> 30:19.960
-Lucky.
-Lucky!

30:20.840 --> 30:21.840
Lucky!

30:21.920 --> 30:23.440
Lucky, buddy. Lucky.

30:23.520 --> 30:25.880
-Lucky!
-Where are you, Lucky?

30:29.640 --> 30:32.120
Where's Lucky?
You didn't find him?

30:44.040 --> 30:45.640
I looked all night, I couldn't find him.

30:46.560 --> 30:48.120
He's nowhere to be found.

30:49.680 --> 30:52.560
Please, don't punish us for this.

30:53.120 --> 30:56.600
Right now,
we have a more important thing to do.

30:57.360 --> 30:59.960
We need to find a new dog to be class pet.

31:01.760 --> 31:06.640
What if we get someone
to replace Lucky for the time being?

31:07.280 --> 31:08.960
What do you all think about that?

31:15.800 --> 31:17.040
-Grab him.
-Hit him.

31:17.120 --> 31:18.080
Go, go.

31:18.160 --> 31:20.160
Get him down! Get him down!

31:20.240 --> 31:21.680
I said sit down!

31:21.760 --> 31:23.040
Sit down!

31:23.120 --> 31:25.200
-Grab him.
-Hold him down.

31:25.280 --> 31:26.720
Right now, you're a dog.

31:26.800 --> 31:28.840
You must sit like a dog

31:28.920 --> 31:31.440
and follow your master's orders.
You understand?

31:31.960 --> 31:34.120
-Sit!
-Push his legs down.

31:34.200 --> 31:35.560
-Get down.
-Grab his legs.

31:36.400 --> 31:38.440
-Stay still. Don't move.
-Stop moving.

31:38.520 --> 31:39.920
Why are you so stubborn?

31:40.560 --> 31:43.360
-Hey, stop it! Do you have a problem?
-Do you wanna try me, asshole?

31:47.240 --> 31:49.640
Don't bully K, guys.

31:50.480 --> 31:51.560
Pull him up.

31:52.120 --> 31:53.960
-Get him to sit up.
-Sit.

31:54.040 --> 31:56.040
Sit up. Come on.

31:57.760 --> 31:59.360
You're so adorable.

32:00.200 --> 32:01.720
Come play fetch with me.

32:06.080 --> 32:08.560
Can you please let K off the leash?

32:12.640 --> 32:17.320
Fetch this for me. One, two…

32:18.600 --> 32:19.680
three.

32:23.840 --> 32:24.960
Go on.

32:26.080 --> 32:27.520
Go fetch your toy.

32:28.800 --> 32:29.720
Go!

32:33.640 --> 32:35.400
He likes to be kicked.

32:39.640 --> 32:40.640
Move it!

32:46.280 --> 32:47.760
Hurry, K.

32:53.080 --> 32:54.040
Pick it up!

32:54.120 --> 32:57.120
One, two, three.

32:58.720 --> 33:00.760
-Attaboy.
-He runs fast.

33:00.840 --> 33:02.480
-Good job!
-Come on.

33:02.560 --> 33:04.360
-Come here.
-Come here!

33:04.440 --> 33:06.000
Hurry up. Come on.

33:24.440 --> 33:25.760
Give me your paw.

33:30.600 --> 33:31.640
Your other paw.

33:34.800 --> 33:37.200
What do you do after giving me your paw?

33:38.160 --> 33:39.680
What do you do next?

33:41.360 --> 33:43.560
That's a good boy.

33:48.880 --> 33:50.440
There, there.

34:24.720 --> 34:26.640
Have some yummy food.

34:29.960 --> 34:31.600
Yum, yum.

34:36.440 --> 34:39.240
See? It's much better to be a dog

34:39.920 --> 34:41.560
than a centipede.

34:42.280 --> 34:43.760
If you're angry,

34:44.840 --> 34:46.920
you can take it out
on the freshmen next year.

34:47.640 --> 34:49.360
If you're still alive.

35:00.880 --> 35:02.120
I'm sorry.

35:02.920 --> 35:05.680
I forgive you, my little puppy.

35:08.600 --> 35:10.120
Please let me go.

35:11.240 --> 35:13.440
What was that? I didn't hear you.

35:14.200 --> 35:15.360
Please let me go.

35:17.040 --> 35:18.840
I won't do it ever again.

35:18.920 --> 35:21.800
-What was that?
-Please let me go.

35:24.520 --> 35:26.120
Please let me go.

35:30.680 --> 35:34.480
Please…

35:36.320 --> 35:37.800
There, there.

35:41.040 --> 35:42.680
In case you get hungry.

35:46.800 --> 35:51.760
Don't go. Please don't go.
Don't leave me.

35:53.680 --> 35:55.400
Please don't go.

36:39.360 --> 36:40.800
You poor thing.

36:45.080 --> 36:46.520
Do you want to get out of here?

36:49.320 --> 36:51.040
Please help me.

37:22.720 --> 37:24.400
What are you doing, Yuri?

37:27.840 --> 37:29.760
Your way takes forever.

37:29.840 --> 37:31.360
I'm impatient.

37:33.440 --> 37:36.080
Hey, everyone! K has run away!

37:41.400 --> 37:43.560
-Get him. Go this way.
-Hey! Hey!

37:50.720 --> 37:53.320
-Come back, asshole!
-Get K here!

37:53.400 --> 37:56.360
Both of you go that way.
You two go this way.

40:53.320 --> 40:55.360
I got so many bites last night.

40:55.440 --> 40:57.480
The mosquito repellent is fucking useless.

40:59.800 --> 41:02.280
The woods are full
of mosquitoes. Can we go home?

41:02.360 --> 41:04.240
Do you want to go home with me?

41:04.320 --> 41:06.680
I got mud in my mouth.

41:06.760 --> 41:08.880
Was it when you were crying to Pae?

41:08.960 --> 41:11.200
-Wait, who else was there?
-What was his name? Was it Yong?

41:11.280 --> 41:14.000
-It was the guy with buckteeth.
-That's right.

41:15.920 --> 41:18.040
Remember when you sang
the faculty's chant?

41:18.120 --> 41:19.560
Damn.

41:21.720 --> 41:23.840
-I don't know.
-Screw him.

41:23.920 --> 41:26.240
He's probably dead.
He was a horrible senior.

41:26.320 --> 41:28.120
He acted like he ran the place.

41:30.240 --> 41:33.000
-Don't compare ourselves to him.
-I'll whoop his ass if I saw him now.

41:33.560 --> 41:38.160
You can't find anyone nicer than us.
We go easy on these freshmen.

41:38.240 --> 41:41.200
-These freshmen have no idea.
-That's true.

41:47.880 --> 41:49.000
No!

41:50.240 --> 41:51.800
Hey! K!

41:51.880 --> 41:52.840
Go after him!

41:53.960 --> 41:55.640
Over here! He's over here!

42:01.640 --> 42:04.440
-Stop right there.
-Come back, asshole.

42:04.520 --> 42:07.000
-Get back here.
-K, get over here.

42:08.240 --> 42:10.640
Get up here. Be a man and get back here.

42:10.720 --> 42:11.920
You're such a coward.

42:12.680 --> 42:14.120
Everyone!

42:14.680 --> 42:16.080
We found Lucky's body.

42:19.160 --> 42:22.080
You scum. How could you do this?

42:22.160 --> 42:23.720
I didn't kill Lucky!

42:24.280 --> 42:27.920
I didn't set him loose!
And I didn't grab Nanno's butt!

42:29.640 --> 42:32.800
She started all of this!
This is all her fault!

42:32.880 --> 42:35.120
She's the reason I'm stuck here
with you assholes!

42:35.200 --> 42:38.040
We don't believe you!

42:38.120 --> 42:40.720
Why won't anyone believe me?

42:40.800 --> 42:42.800
So, this is your way of helping?

42:43.440 --> 42:45.840
That's right. Isn't it fun?

42:46.560 --> 42:48.520
It's so much faster than your way.

42:51.200 --> 42:55.680
You even killed Mr. Lucky.
Was that really necessary, Yuri?

42:58.400 --> 42:59.520
Everyone!

43:00.800 --> 43:03.760
Since K killed Lucky,
he needs to pay for it.

43:04.520 --> 43:06.680
Whoever hits K in the head the most times

43:06.760 --> 43:11.080
gets to be the head of the freshmen class
and can skip the initiation ritual.

43:19.000 --> 43:21.640
Mr. Lucky would be honored to die
for such a good cause.

43:24.040 --> 43:27.080
Do you think that if we let K live,

43:27.160 --> 43:29.840
he'll just stop bullying
the next class of freshmen?

43:31.800 --> 43:33.760
You're too fast to judge, Yuri.

43:37.200 --> 43:41.120
I can't believe
those words came out of your mouth.

43:41.840 --> 43:43.640
If you keep talking like this,

43:43.720 --> 43:45.760
I really am going to have
to take your job from you.

43:46.320 --> 43:49.320
-Don't let him get away!
-What are you waiting for?
